Z||000008||PearlBlueSoul||12-12-2000||04:58 PM||||Man, what is it with people and Supra tailights?????  I saw a CRX with supra lights once too, now this??  <P>Eh, I duno.  Ferrari conversions I can see because that completes the look, but not unless you're trying to copy the whole car.  <P>Don't get me wrong, it looks ok, and the top pics look great.  Just I'm kinda edgy about people using tailights from Supras, MR2s, etc.  cuz I've seen alot of hondas use them.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">       <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.||||reg||1
