Z||000019||RedOktober||12-12-2000||10:47 PM||||That is ugly...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>But who ever did it had balls, a wild imagination, lots ans lots of time and money, and a wrecked Fiero...<P>This is one that took the old saying ... if you have nothing but lemons.. Go make lemonaide...tooo seriously.<P>It may be ugly to me, but I'm sure some one thought it was a post modern nevo retro thingamajiggy that makes you look twice while it zooms by. <P>Now if we could take his glassing skills, mix in with some stylish design ( anyone???), BAMBAM's concept about rebuilding the Fiero, and Money from everyone in the forum, we might just have a winner...<P>------------------<BR>86 SE V6 Auto Turbo Going 3.4 OHV "Red Oktober"<BR>86 2M4 5sp (Beater) "Blackie"<BR>87 GT "Blue Flame"<p>[This message has been edited by RedOktober (edited 12-12-2000).]||||reg||1
