Z||000031||pHoOl||12-14-2000||10:21 AM||||What does everybody think about that Jalepeno?  I kinda think that it is more like pissing on the fiero than a ferrari kit is.  At least if you had a ferrari kit, you'd look cool and such.  If you're going for a dune buggy, that's fine, but i don't think that a fiero looks good as a dune buggy.  There is a reason that they made it with 5 inches of clearence at the bottom, and it wasn't for off roading.<P>just my $.02<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
